03:33:23.680 --> 03:33:25.940
So I'm saying it's 1-1 right now. I don't know. I think we're going to

03:33:26.440 --> 03:33:28.800
take them out, but then we're going to— okay, then we're going to make a

03:33:29.300 --> 03:33:32.620
motion at some point, like later in the meeting, that we'll hire a landscape architect

03:33:33.120 --> 03:33:36.900
and we'll do a corridor landscape plan. That's already in

03:33:37.400 --> 03:33:39.400
the funding. Yeah, so I don't think we need to make a motion because that's

03:33:39.900 --> 03:33:42.290
in the budget. So when we put together that proposal for MAG, we have all

03:33:42.790 --> 03:33:46.250
that in the estimate. We're going to want to review that plan too.

03:33:46.590 --> 03:33:49.050
Like, where you can say, hey, look, here's what the landscaping is going to look

03:33:49.550 --> 03:33:51.570
like. I think we'd want to see that before you move forward. And we will

03:33:52.070 --> 03:33:54.800
absolutely bring that to you guys. Absolutely. I mean, that design will take months.

03:33:55.070 --> 03:33:59.210
It will. It's not a quick process. And if there's opportunity

03:33:59.710 --> 03:34:02.670
to relocate those trees— I don't— I'm not a tree hugger,

03:34:03.170 --> 03:34:06.440
but there's a lot of trees in there. So we got to relocate

03:34:06.940 --> 03:34:10.006
them somewhere if if that's possible, and we always try to.

03:34:10.087 --> 03:34:13.734
It's not always feasible when they come out. If not, we reuse all the trees.

03:34:13.846 --> 03:34:17.316
We mulch it, and we use it throughout the city, so nothing gets wasted or

03:34:17.816 --> 03:34:21.574
thrown away. Okay, so was there any other questions on the TMP

03:34:21.638 --> 03:34:25.092
as a whole aside from ranches? Go ahead. Yeah, I had a question. So the

03:34:25.592 --> 03:34:29.045
last page as well, page 222. So you said that

03:34:29.109 --> 03:34:33.377
that one was not updated. There are some roads in there. that are not reflected

03:34:33.877 --> 03:34:37.249
in some of the other pages. So do

03:34:37.749 --> 03:34:40.230
we need to make— do we need to worry about that? For instance, I'm looking

