that connection. That was deleted off a year ago.

03:35:10.440 --> 03:35:14.560
Yeah,

03:35:15.060 --> 03:35:16.640
yeah, because we cut on all the other maps, but on the wildlife one,

03:35:17.140 --> 03:35:20.580
