03:35:21.080 --> 03:35:24.455
if there's no other question right now, this is a public hearing. We good to

03:35:24.955 --> 03:35:28.695
move forward? Yeah. All right, we'll go ahead and open the public hearing at 8:35.

03:35:29.920 --> 03:35:33.053
