03:35:47.773 --> 03:35:51.382
Um, Mayor and Council, my name is Quinn Lindy. I am the principal

03:35:51.576 --> 03:35:55.560
of the new high school that was opening in Saratoga Springs. First and foremost,

03:35:55.624 --> 03:35:59.336
what you should know, Mayor, is, you know, I've done my fair share of

03:36:01.180 --> 03:36:04.098
Big Mac challenges, hot wing challenges,

03:36:04.695 --> 03:36:08.244
Chick-fil-A. I had 40 chicken nuggets in 3 minutes.

03:36:09.196 --> 03:36:12.584
You always say no when the students asked you to do stupid

03:36:13.084 --> 03:36:16.226
things like that. So just on the record, say no next time. You'll be better

03:36:16.726 --> 03:36:20.443
off for it. Thank you. Thank you for it. I prepared something

03:36:20.475 --> 03:36:23.333
more formal, and I don't know if 3 minutes is going to be enough time.

03:36:23.847 --> 03:36:27.347
And so I'm going to keep my comments short. Most importantly,

03:36:28.825 --> 03:36:32.678
this road that we talked about in our TMP plan to connect

03:36:33.304 --> 03:36:36.548
Golden Eagle down through the new high school into

03:36:36.596 --> 03:36:40.096
Saratoga Springs, this road will provide important traffic support

03:36:40.128 --> 03:36:43.678
and additional access for high school students. As enrollment continues to

03:36:44.178 --> 03:36:47.662
increase, having multiple routes into and out of our new high school in our community

03:36:47.694 --> 03:36:51.437
will become increasingly important. A direct connection here will

03:36:51.469 --> 03:36:54.843
provide our families and students with more options for reaching school and other

03:36:55.343 --> 03:36:59.341
community destinations. It will help distribute traffic rather than concentrating

03:36:59.841 --> 03:37:02.634
it on a limited number of existing roads. Why I say this is I have

03:37:02.714 --> 03:37:06.409
opened a new school, I have rebuilt a school of 20— for

03:37:06.909 --> 03:37:10.216
2,800 students at Hillcrest High School, and I've currently, when I look left my last

03:37:10.248 --> 03:37:14.086
job building a $65 million extension onto Murray High School.

03:37:15.161 --> 03:37:18.453
I have been in my fair share of high schools. I will

03:37:18.953 --> 03:37:22.226
submit to the record a data analysis that I put together of the last

03:37:22.726 --> 03:37:26.144
20 high schools that were built in the state of Utah. Westlake and Cedar

03:37:26.644 --> 03:37:29.982
Valley are also on that list. I won't go through that entire thing

03:37:30.078 --> 03:37:33.851
here, but I will refer you to that record and where we currently

03:37:34.351 --> 03:37:37.591
fall in Alpine School District. With the number of access points into high school?

03:37:38.121 --> 03:37:41.395
Quite frankly, not very good. In fact,

03:37:41.411 --> 03:37:45.134
we are in the just above average. Schools down

03:37:45.198 --> 03:37:48.215
in St. George, schools in Nebo School District are much, much better.

03:37:48.633 --> 03:37:52.308
Meaning on average, we are sending about 900 students

03:37:52.808 --> 03:37:55.871
per access point compared to our counterparts across the state.

03:37:55.935 --> 03:37:59.289
If you don't believe me on this, go read the recent news articles about the

03:37:59.789 --> 03:38:02.958
$225 million building they built Cypress High School,

03:38:03.328 --> 03:38:07.104
and the first issue and the first news article that came out was parents waiting

03:38:07.604 --> 03:38:10.061
an hour to drop their kids off at school due to the lack of access

03:38:10.561 --> 03:38:14.616
points into the community. When communities are physically connected,

03:38:14.649 --> 03:38:18.179
it becomes easier for people to interact, participate, and build relationships. I want to be

03:38:18.679 --> 03:38:21.827
very— 30 seconds remaining. I want to be very clear, this is not an Eagle

03:38:22.327 --> 03:38:25.319
Mountain High School. It will not be a Saratoga Springs High School. I live in

03:38:25.367 --> 03:38:29.211
Eagle Mountain and I have since 2013. and I am an Eagle Mountaineer. This school

03:38:29.661 --> 03:38:32.872
will represent both of our communities, and I want you to know that I put

03:38:33.372 --> 03:38:37.336
my full support behind our TMP plan to build and connect our roads

03:38:37.368 --> 03:38:41.350
because one day our marching band and our programs will march

03:38:41.462 --> 03:38:44.754
through Silver Lake and they'll march through Evans Ranch and any other area

03:38:45.254 --> 03:38:48.367
our district sees fit in that boundary study. I also want you

03:38:48.867 --> 03:38:51.032
to know that I will advocate with the new school district— Your time is up.

03:38:51.096 --> 03:38:54.801
Thank you. Eagle Mountain in our new boundary study

03:38:55.301 --> 03:38:58.756
that will begin in September. Thank you. So any of those other documents,

03:38:58.772 --> 03:39:04.390
if you wanna send your full comment, just email it to Lacey, to recorder@eaglemountain.gov,

03:39:04.975 --> 03:39:08.141
