03:40:24.872 --> 03:40:29.120
To me, it's become so much more than just the Silver Lake Parkway connection.

03:40:30.266 --> 03:40:34.031
It's about improving Woodhaven, it's about improving Golden Eagle,

03:40:34.792 --> 03:40:38.340
