03:40:49.111 --> 03:40:52.324
give better opportunities to the students and families that are living there.

03:40:53.599 --> 03:40:56.548
And I just wanted to know that we are behind that plan. Thank you for

03:40:57.048 --> 03:41:00.759
your time. Ben Perez.

03:41:08.667 --> 03:41:12.457
Good evening, Mayor and Council. I just wanted to keep my comments brief

03:41:12.957 --> 03:41:16.198
about the same support for this master plan change.

03:41:17.097 --> 03:41:20.694
I wanted to just share really briefly, my son attended the ALL

03:41:21.194 --> 03:41:24.885
program at Silver Lake Elementary last year, and one thing that he was adamant about

03:41:25.385 --> 03:41:27.470
was that he did not want us to pick him up in front of the

03:41:27.970 --> 03:41:31.898
school. He wanted us to park right down the street and he wanted

03:41:32.398 --> 03:41:35.489
to cross on his own and get in the car. He didn't want to

03:41:35.537 --> 03:41:39.176
