03:42:05.767 --> 03:42:09.910
light getting put in there really makes me happy just because kids' safety is

03:42:09.958 --> 03:42:13.252
massive. Sure, it will connect to the high school and it will open

03:42:13.300 --> 03:42:16.385
up the opportunity there for our neighborhood, but for kids to have

03:42:16.885 --> 03:42:20.531
another possibility, 'cause I can't tell you how many of those kids after school are

03:42:21.031 --> 03:42:24.994
walking by themselves home. Yeah. they need some kind of traffic control

03:42:25.460 --> 03:42:29.203
